//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Pre-Dialogue Intro

title: SecondSpiritIntro
---
// Variables ---------------------------------------------
<<declare $secondSpiritMet = false>>

// Dialogue Jumper ---------------------------------------
<<declare $secondspiritTalkTo = 0>>

<<if $secondspiritTalkTo == 1>>
    <<jump SpiritFiller1>>
<<elseif $secondspiritTalkTo == 2>>
    <<jump finishedIntroMinigame>>
<<endif>>
//---------------------------------------


<<play_cutscene PlayerCutsceneAnimator character_scared>>
<<play_cutscene CutsceneAnimator spiky-spirit-appear>>
<<play_emote_plain player_emote exclaim>>

Green Spirit: <wave>Yawn...</wave> Hmm...? Who is it?

Dawn: Not again!

Green Spirit: Awfully rude you are... Who let you in?

Dawn: I own this place! 

Green Spirit: Wait, Anne? No, you don't look like her. Who are you?

Dawn: I could ask the same thing. I really wasn't expecting to see more of you today.

Green Spirit: You must be talking about Maple. Gosh, I thought they left a long time ago.

Dawn: It seems they think the same thing. Anyways, I've got to get to cooking. Do you know where the cooking grease is?

Green Spirit: Cooking grease? Oh, yeah, look in the pantry. That's where Anne kept all her "food".
Green Spirit: Now, please, leave me be.

// Dialogue Progress Set
<<set $secondspiritTalkTo = 1>>
<<set $secondSpiritMet = true>>
===



//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// After Pre-Dialogue

title: SecondSpirit_Filler_1
---
Green Spirit: Don't you have stuff to do? <wave>Off you go</wave>.
===



//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Stock room?

title: searchingStockRoomGrease
---
<<declare $foundGreaseItem = false>>

Just a bunch of old stuff...
Where to look?
    -> Inside the boxes
        Dawn: Nothing here but dust and cobwebs...
    -> Behind the cans
        Dawn: Ew... I think I saw a spider!
    -> In the luggage
        Something [o]glimmers[/o] inside...
        Dawn: Oh there it is!
        <<set_story StoryManager foundGrease>>
        <<set $foundGreaseItem = true>>

//Retry if didn't find
<<if $foundGreaseItem == false>>
    <<jump searchingStockRoomGrease>>
<<endif>>
===



//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1st Dialogue

title: SecondSpirit_1stDialogue
---
// Branch off intro if you have met or not
<<if $secondSpiritMet == true>>
    <<detour SpiritFiller1>>
<<elseif $secondSpiritMet == false>>
    <<detour finishedIntroMinigame>>
<<endif>>


Green Spirit: You sure do cook like her. I could smell it from the other end of the house.
Green Spirit: She could always lure me back with her cooking.

Dawn: Well, I'm glad you like it.
Dawn: Are you... going to transform too?

Green Spirit: Transform?

<<if $secondSpiritMet == false>>
    Green Spirit: Oh, you must have met Maple.
<<endif>>

Green Spirit: Would you like me to change form?

Dawn: Ah, well, I thought it was an involuntary thing.

Green Spirit: <wave>Involuntary</wave>? Perhaps for weaker-willed spirits.
Green Spirit: I suppose it's been a while. Give me one moment and I'll show you.

//Spirit Transforms here

Green Spirit: See, voluntary.
Green Spirit: Nostalgic. I've always had a weakness for Anne's egg and bacon.

Dawn: Huh. Do you have with any new recipes?

Green Spirit: Do I look like a recipe book?
Green Spirit: Though, there is a dish that I've quite missed...
Green Spirit: You know what, today's you're lucky day. I very rarely bless humans with my expertise.
Green Spirit: But, first, you'll need to find some ingredients for me. I believe there are some eggs at the thing they call a "lake", nearby.
===
//
// 1st Dialogue Branch -------------------------------------------------------
//
title: SecondSpirit_1stDialogue_Met
---
Green Spirit: I see you've cooked up a storm.
===
//
//
title: SecondSpirit_1stDialogue_NotMet
---
Green Spirit: <wave>Yawn</wave>. That smells good...
Green Spirit: Gosh, Anne, you've finally come back.
Green Spirit: No, wait, you don't look like her. Who are you?

Dawn: I'm Dawn, her Granddaughter.

Green Spirit: Granddaughter... That makes sense.
===